                                "sense_id": "d608aed0-6454-36e7-a831-2df8670878da",
                                "text": "Der Rath meldete ſich am 2ten bey dem Generalfeldmarſchalle Scheremetew, bath um Beſtaͤtigung der Privilegien, und erhielt zur Antwort, daß dieſe Sache dem Generaladmirale Bolowin aufgetragen waͤre.",
                                "translation": "On the 2nd, the council got in touch with the general field marshal Scheremetew, pleaded for confirmation of the privileges and received as the answer that this matter has been assigned to the general admiral Bolowin.",
